      "story_id": "S1",
      "criterion_id": "AC01",
      "text": "AC01 Thin membranes and multi-strand fibre bundles form one connected material. A static node diagram with flying points is NO-GO.",
      "source_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-spec-v1.json",
      "addendum_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-testability-v1.json",
      "associated_attempts": [
        "AG-VISUAL-004-ARCHIBALD",
        "AG-VISUAL-004-FORGE"
      ],
      "allocation": "Shared task cost, not individually separable"
    },
    {
      "epic": "AG-VISUAL-004-EPIC",
      "version": 1,
      "story_id": "S1",
      "criterion_id": "AC02",
      "text": "AC02 Broad, continuous swells deform membranes and bundles together while the camera stays fixed. Camera travel or uniform pulsing is not the only source of life.",
      "source_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-spec-v1.json",
      "addendum_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-testability-v1.json",
      "associated_attempts": [
        "AG-VISUAL-004-ARCHIBALD",
        "AG-VISUAL-004-FORGE"
      ],
      "allocation": "Shared task cost, not individually separable"
    },
    {
      "epic": "AG-VISUAL-004-EPIC",
      "version": 1,
      "story_id": "S1",
      "criterion_id": "AC03",
      "text": "AC03 Ambient motion and work impulses are visibly separate: waiting areas only drift slowly, distant areas stay calm, and the gold responsibility seals remain stable reference points.",
      "source_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-spec-v1.json",
      "addendum_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-testability-v1.json",
      "associated_attempts": [
        "AG-VISUAL-004-ARCHIBALD",
        "AG-VISUAL-004-FORGE"
      ],
      "allocation": "Shared task cost, not individually separable"
    },
    {
      "epic": "AG-VISUAL-004-EPIC",
      "version": 1,
      "story_id": "S2",
      "criterion_id": "AC04",
      "text": "AC04 For a work event, fibres thicken locally at the actor, recipient and caused_by areas, and neighbouring surfaces are pulled in.",
      "source_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-spec-v1.json",
      "addendum_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-testability-v1.json",
      "associated_attempts": [
        "AG-VISUAL-004-ARCHIBALD",
        "AG-VISUAL-004-FORGE"
      ],
      "allocation": "Shared task cost, not individually separable"
    },
    {
      "epic": "AG-VISUAL-004-EPIC",
      "version": 1,
      "story_id": "S2",
      "criterion_id": "AC05",
      "text": "AC05 Parallel work is visible in the same frame (E09/E10, E12/E13, E32/E33), with no relay hand-off between them.",
      "source_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-spec-v1.json",
      "addendum_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-testability-v1.json",
      "associated_attempts": [
        "AG-VISUAL-004-ARCHIBALD",
        "AG-VISUAL-004-FORGE"
      ],
      "allocation": "Shared task cost, not individually separable"
    },
    {
      "epic": "AG-VISUAL-004-EPIC",
      "version": 1,
      "story_id": "S2",
      "criterion_id": "AC06",
      "text": "AC06 Scout expedition: E03 extends Scout's area outward and E05 brings back a fan of sources. Discarded finds stay muted and the selected find lands at the target. This activity is tied to the fixture times and ends with them.",
      "source_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-spec-v1.json",
      "addendum_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-testability-v1.json",
      "associated_attempts": [
        "AG-VISUAL-004-ARCHIBALD",
        "AG-VISUAL-004-FORGE"
      ],
      "allocation": "Shared task cost, not individually separable"
    },
    {
      "epic": "AG-VISUAL-004-EPIC",
      "version": 1,
      "story_id": "S2",
      "criterion_id": "AC07",
      "text": "AC07 Argus E11 creates opposing pull between the bridge and the withdrawable letter. Other areas keep working.",
      "source_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-spec-v1.json",
      "addendum_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-testability-v1.json",
      "associated_attempts": [
        "AG-VISUAL-004-ARCHIBALD",
        "AG-VISUAL-004-FORGE"
      ],
      "allocation": "Shared task cost, not individually separable"
    },
    {
      "epic": "AG-VISUAL-004-EPIC",
      "version": 1,
      "story_id": "S2",
      "criterion_id": "AC08",
      "text": "AC08 Break E15: the house disappears, the bridge remains and a visible tear appears.",
      "source_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-spec-v1.json",
      "addendum_ref": "specifications/AG-VISUAL-004-testability-v1.json",
      "associated_attempts": [
